+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a version numbering scheme. None of the repository's documentation (README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, CHANGELOG.md, docs/doc.md, CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md, BENCHMARKS.md) states a policy for how version numbers are chosen or incremented; the CHANGELOG only lists released tag names (e.g. `v1.12.0`) without describing the rules behind them, so no current scheme can be reported here.
